# Project conventions

## Stack

- PHP web templates under `src/Web/*/template.php`
- Primary styles: `public/css/moh-layout.css`
- Shared partials: `src/Web/Shared/`
- Public assets: `public/` (css, js, images, media)

## Do

- Extend existing page templates and shared includes
- Keep routes in `config/common/routes.php` when adding pages
- Use i18n via `public/js/i18n.js` for user-facing copy that must switch language
- Match existing naming and MOH layout structure

## Do not

- Introduce React, Vue, Tailwind, or a new CSS framework unless the user explicitly asks
- Rewrite nav/footer structure without being asked
- Duplicate styles that already exist in `moh-layout.css`
